# Citation metadata (Citation File Format 1.2.0). GitHub reads this file for "Cite this repository".
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Apelora Fabric in your work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Apelora Fabric"
abstract: >-
  An open-source platform for designing, connecting, deploying and operating distributed
  applications from reusable modules on a cluster of Linux servers. Applications are drawn
  in a visual designer; a Rust control plane turns the drawing into Incus instances, OVN
  networks, access rules, service addresses and supervised replicas.
authors:
  - given-names: Tamir
    family-names: Suliman
repository-code: "https://github.com/Apelora/apelora-fabric"
url: "https://github.com/Apelora/apelora-fabric"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - incus
  - lxc
  - ovn
  - containers
  - distributed-systems
  - visual-programming
  - infrastructure
  - control-plane
